{"seq":2,"at":"2026-10-20","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a2088"},"reason":"Rewritten by the merge to take in the printed cards' questions.","by":"merge technology/computing","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-ingest/decisions/technology__computing.g1.json","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",374],["-","PC, running "],["=",2],["-","DOS, "],["=",12],["-","1981."],["+","1981, so the first operating system installed on it was MS-DOS (sold as PC DOS). Windows itself began as a graphical shell on top of DOS: Windows 1.0 appeared on 20 November 1985, and Windows 10 followed on 29 July 2015, 30 years later, give or take a few months."],["=",832]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",362],["-","mit PC DOS "],["=",14],["-","Markt."],["+","Markt, und das erste darauf installierte Betriebssystem war damit MS-DOS (als PC DOS). Windows selbst begann als grafische Oberfläche auf DOS: Windows 1.0 erschien am 20. November 1985, Windows 10 folgte am 29. Juli 2015, knapp 30 Jahre später."],["=",782]]}]},
