{"seq":5,"at":"2026-10-21","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a2088"},"reason":"Proofread (reasons in the entries above / the batch report).","by":"enrich batch 222","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-enrich/enrich-report/a1908-a2621.md","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",390],["-","so"],["+","and"],["=",17],["-","MS-DOS"],["+","MS-DOS,"],["=",1],["-","(sold"],["+","which"],["=",1],["-","as"],["+","IBM"],["=",1],["+","sold under its own name, "],["=",2],["-","DOS)."],["+","DOS."],["=",902]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",392],["-","damit"],["+","MS-DOS,"],["=",1],["-","MS-DOS"],["+","das"],["=",1],["-","(als"],["+","IBM"],["=",1],["+","unter eigenem Namen als "],["=",2],["-","DOS)."],["+","DOS"],["=",1],["+","verkaufte. "],["=",833]]},{"field":"notesEn","old":"","new":"IBM shipped MS-DOS under its own name, PC DOS 1.0 – “PC DOS” is also accepted. Windows 1.0 (20 November 1985) to Windows 10 (29 July 2015) is 29 years and 8 months, i.e. about 30 years."},{"field":"notesDe","old":"","new":"IBM lieferte MS-DOS unter eigenem Namen als PC DOS 1.0 aus – „PC DOS“ gilt ebenfalls. Von Windows 1.0 (20. November 1985) bis Windows 10 (29. Juli 2015) vergingen 29 Jahre und 8 Monate, also rund 30 Jahre."}],"hash":"dce5d6dbeaa8"},
